# Signing material must never enter version control — EXCEPT the managed debug
# keystore: it is a standard debug-grade key (storepass android) committed so
# every machine/reset signs with the SAME certificate and updates install in
# place. Never put a real release keystore here.
/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
!keystores/deeyoung-debug.keystore

# Firebase config (contains public identifiers only, but keep out of VCS)
/app/google-services.json
